    <Object Type="Vector.CANalyzer.Panels.Design.StaticTextControl, Vector.CANalyzer.Panels.CommonControls, Version=11.0.55.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null" Name="StaticTextControl1" Children="Controls" ControlName="Static Text">
      <Property Name="Name">StaticTextControl1</Property>
      <Property Name="Size">228, 104</Property>
      <Property Name="Location">13, 86</Property>
      <Property Name="Text">说明：
1. 输入模组组地址和节点地址
2. 仿真BCM发诸多指令选中不同节点点亮
3. 仿真BCM指定模组灭灯
4. 观察模组会不会变量再变暗
测试目的：
LIN命令从buffer赋值过程中会不会被
中断打断，赋值错了别的节点的命令。</Property>
    </Object>
